<title>SWEDEN: GOLF-SCANDINAVIAN MASTERS FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCANDINAVIAN MASTERS FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the</p>
<p>first round of the Scandinavian Masters on Thursday (British</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>65 Costantino Rocca (Italy)</p>
<p>66 Padraig Harrington (Ireland), Jose Rivero (Spain)</p>
<p>67 Mark Roe, Ignacio Garrido, Joakim Haeggman (Sweden)</p>
<p>68 Miles Tunnicliff, Steven Bottomley, Gary Evans,</p>
<p>Domingo Hospital (Spain), Robert Karlsson (Sweden),</p>
<p>Silvio Grappasonni (Italy), Mark Mouland</p>
<p>69 Stephen Field, David Howell, Michael Jonzon (Sweden),</p>
<p>Darren Clarke, Jeff Remesy (France), Paolo Quirici</p>
<p>(Switzerland), Paul Lawrie, Jose Maria Olazabal</p>
<p>(Spain), Per-Ulrik Johansson (Sweden), Raymond</p>
<p>Russell, John Mellor</p>
<p>70 Marten Olander (Sweden), Steve Webster, Peter Hedblom</p>
<p>(Sweden), Alberto Binaghi (Italy), Dennis Edlund</p>
<p>(Sweden), David Higgins (Ireland), Iain Pyman, Jesper</p>
<p>Parnevik (Sweden), David Gilford, Adam Hunter, David</p>
<p>Carter, Ronan Rafferty, Mark James, Ross Drummond,</p>
<p>Daniel Olsson (Sweden)</p>
